1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The train to Hamburg leaves from platform 4.

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Der Zug nach Hamburg fährt von Gleis 4.</font>

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,250
It is ten minutes late today.

4
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,250
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Er hat heute zehn Minuten Verspätung.</font>

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The bakery next to the station opens at six.
They sell fresh rolls.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,600
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Die Bäckerei am Bahnhof öffnet um sechs.</font>

7
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,000
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Sie verkauft frische Brötchen.</font>

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,500
<i>Rain is coming.</i>

9
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,600
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Morgen scheint wieder die Sonne.</font>

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Take an umbrella with you.

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
{\an8}<font color="#ffff00">Gute Reise!</font>
